    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Dashboard Overview",
      "description": "High-level overview of what this dashboard measures and why it matters to leadership, delivery teams, and developers.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "## GitHub Copilot Enterprise Usage & Adoption\n\nThis dashboard shows how GitHub Copilot is being adopted and used across the enterprise.\n\n**Leadership:** understand license utilization, adoption growth, and whether Copilot is delivering measurable value.  \n**Teams:** identify which workflows, IDEs, features, and languages are seeing the strongest adoption.  \n**Developers:** see how day-to-day Copilot usage translates into prompts, completions, acceptances, and practical coding activity.\n\nUse this dashboard to answer three questions: **Are we using the licenses we pay for? Is adoption growing? Which usage patterns appear to create the most value?**\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      }
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"
      },
      "description": "Total Copilot seats currently assigned across the enterprise. Helps leadership compare purchased capacity to actual usage.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#d08cff",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
